  "body": "Refs #45\n\n## Changes\n\n- Animate floating labels in Outlined and Filled text fields when focus or the value changes.\n- Use the same motion progress for the Outlined border notch. Keep the editor and action in place.\n- Settle immediately when Reduce Motion is active. Wrap long labels above the field.\n\n## Verification\n\n- The recovered source matches the 684-file candidate verified on macOS.\n- The macOS workspace passed 1,570 Rust tests and three WebAssembly checks. Metal ran 18 tests.\n- Five headless macOS suites passed 24,973 checks, including 349 Material steps and 20 input method steps. The native replay verified 14 PNGs through Page.screenshot, CLI and MCP.\n- The original Linux branch and pull request workflows checked the same source tree. Each passed 1,545 Rust tests, three WebAssembly checks and 25,350 browser and bridge checks across eight cases. The verified SwiftShader screenshots include M347 to M350.\n\n[macOS source patch, test results, and screenshots](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/d74ad36e0c588a4a43fb3a43f11d1ce5fe7918f4/docs/evidence/md3/text-field-label-motion-v0167-candidate)\n\n[Linux reports, exact checkout receipts, and screenshots](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/29f771c3022678fe9d7c8ffc314d3dd80e08200b/docs/evidence/md3/text-field-label-motion-v0167-hosted)\n",
  "changed_files": 17,
